// this function opened straight on getdir().  That assertion is false the
// moment the hero has hurt a leg: seed0360 kicks a wall three times, the
// second kick_ouch sets wounded legs, and C's THIRD ^D (step 548) never asks
// for a direction at all — it prints "Your right leg is in no shape for
// kicking." and pages it with display_nhwindow(WIN_MESSAGE, TRUE), a blocking
// --More-- that C holds across the next 21 recorded keys ("j", "h", ">", "k"
// are not dismiss chars) until the space at step 570.  This port asked "In
