        // when there isn't one.  The guard is `!In_endgame`, NOT `!newdungeon`:
        // a BRANCH descent (Dungeons-of-Doom -> Gnomish Mines) is at_stairs with
        // newdungeon TRUE, and C still places the hero on the branch stairway.
