// result topline (game._resultMessage) as a GENUINE message boundary, recording
// the "  " separator offset so the width-driven more() can page at that boundary
// later.  The join offsets live in a string-keyed side-channel
// (game._resultMessageJoins = { src, joins }) so a stale record for an unrelated
// earlier _resultMessage is ignored (src mismatch → start fresh), mirroring the
